{
    "title": "Beast Lord: The New Land",
    "description": "- What will happen if animals take center stage in a strategy war game?\r\n- What is it like to be the King of Beasts, leading an army of animals into battle across the land?\r\n- Who will emerge as the ultimate winner in this epic battle across the ages, when lions face off against dinosaurs and wolves encounter mammoths?\r\n\r\nBeast Lord: The New Land is a massive multi-player, real-time strategy war game where you, as the Lord of the Beasts, lead your beast tribes in search of new territories and rebuild your homeland amidst the deteriorating environment.\r\n\r\nFree Development\r\n\u25c6 Explore, expand, gather, produce, develop, and fight freely on this new continent. Each animal has its role, working together to build a new home.\r\n\r\nEncyclopedic Beast Archive\r\n\u25c6 With over a hundred beast profiles, it's an encyclopedia of the animal kingdom. Every animal comes with detailed backgrounds and behavior descriptions, and is designed with exclusive skills based on its characteristics. You can freely organize your animal troops, combining different skills to create your customized beast army.\r\n\r\nRealistic Environment\r\n\u25c6 The forest environment is faithfully recreated, offering stunning detail at every zoom level!\r\n\r\nHunting Outside the City\r\n\u25c6 Danger lurks in the outer forests. As both predator and prey, stay alert. Choose your enemies wisely based on your power, use your resources strategically, and master skill countering to achieve victory after victory.\r\n\r\nMegabeast System\r\n\u25c6 Dinosaurs once reigned supreme. In the game, you can obtain dinosaur eggs by defeating wild creatures. Hatch these eggs to get your own dinosaurs and dominate any battlefield with the help of their superior skills!\r\n\r\nAlliance Warfare\r\n\u25c6 As your home grows stronger and your beast warriors grow mightier, join forces in alliances, fight shoulder-to-shoulder with allies, expand your territory, and achieve final victory through combined efforts and strategic prowess.\r\n\r\n=======Contact Us======= \r\nWe provide considerate service to give a personalized service experience! \r\nIf you encounter any game-related problems, you can contact us through the following channels.\uff1a \r\n\r\nOfficial Line: @beastlordofficial \r\nOfficial Discord: https://discord.gg/GCYza8vZ6y \r\nOfficial Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/beastlordofficial \r\nOfficial Email Address: beastlord@staruniongame.com \r\nOfficial TikTok: https://www.tiktok.com/@beastlord_global \r\n\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://static-sites.nightmetaverse.com/privacy.html \r\nTerms of Service: https://static-sites.nightmetaverse.com/terms.html",
    "descriptionHTML": "- What will happen if animals take center stage in a strategy war game?<br>- What is it like to be the King of Beasts, leading an army of animals into battle across the land?<br>- Who will emerge as the ultimate winner in this epic battle across the ages, when lions face off against dinosaurs and wolves encounter mammoths?<br><br>Beast Lord: The New Land is a massive multi-player, real-time strategy war game where you, as the Lord of the Beasts, lead your beast tribes in search of new territories and rebuild your homeland amidst the deteriorating environment.<br><br>Free Development<br>\u25c6 Explore, expand, gather, produce, develop, and fight freely on this new continent. Each animal has its role, working together to build a new home.<br><br>Encyclopedic Beast Archive<br>\u25c6 With over a hundred beast profiles, it&#39;s an encyclopedia of the animal kingdom. Every animal comes with detailed backgrounds and behavior descriptions, and is designed with exclusive skills based on its characteristics. You can freely organize your animal troops, combining different skills to create your customized beast army.<br><br>Realistic Environment<br>\u25c6 The forest environment is faithfully recreated, offering stunning detail at every zoom level!<br><br>Hunting Outside the City<br>\u25c6 Danger lurks in the outer forests. As both predator and prey, stay alert. Choose your enemies wisely based on your power, use your resources strategically, and master skill countering to achieve victory after victory.<br><br>Megabeast System<br>\u25c6 Dinosaurs once reigned supreme. In the game, you can obtain dinosaur eggs by defeating wild creatures. Hatch these eggs to get your own dinosaurs and dominate any battlefield with the help of their superior skills!<br><br>Alliance Warfare<br>\u25c6 As your home grows stronger and your beast warriors grow mightier, join forces in alliances, fight shoulder-to-shoulder with allies, expand your territory, and achieve final victory through combined efforts and strategic prowess.<br><br>=======Contact Us======= <br>We provide considerate service to give a personalized service experience! <br>If you encounter any game-related problems, you can contact us through the following channels.\uff1a <br><br>Official Line: @beastlordofficial <br>Official Discord: https://discord.gg/GCYza8vZ6y <br>Official Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/beastlordofficial <br>Official Email Address: beastlord@staruniongame.com <br>Official TikTok: https://www.tiktok.com/@beastlord_global <br><br>Privacy Policy: https://static-sites.nightmetaverse.com/privacy.html <br>Terms of Service: https://static-sites.nightmetaverse.com/terms.html",
